# The TI-58C: filled, then switched off and on again: the constant memory keeps it (first step 11).
model TI-58C
boot
keys 4 2 STO 0 5
keys Fix 2
keys 3 Op 1 7
keys LRN 1 + 2 = R/S LRN
keys CLR
power-cycle
boot
keys RCL 0 5
keys Op 1 6
keys RST R/S
idle
reset
boot
keys RCL 0 5
cold-boot
boot
keys RCL 0 5
